<p dir=auto>1)<strong>Fresh Run:</strong> <strong>run_llm_agent_as_node()</strong> populates <strong>event.output</strong>. <strong>_track_event_in_context()</strong> sees this and correctly assigns the string/schema to <strong>ctx.output.</strong></p>
<p dir=auto>2)<strong>Persistence:</strong> <strong>_consume_event_queue()</strong> sets <strong>event.output = None</strong> to optimize for <strong>message_as_output</strong> logic and saves the raw <strong>event.content</strong> to the <strong>Session</strong>.</p>
